WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:37.840
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:37.920 --> 01:40.800
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

02:02.320 --> 02:03.240
Qingchuan.

02:11.000 --> 02:12.360
My lord, what can I do for you?

02:12.440 --> 02:13.520
How's it going outside?

02:13.600 --> 02:14.720
Still full of spies.

02:14.800 --> 02:17.000
They were sent by Lord Yunzhong
to spy on you.

02:21.520 --> 02:23.720
My lord, we'd better stay at home

02:24.400 --> 02:26.360
and let Lord Yunzhong
remove his suspicions.

02:26.440 --> 02:28.360
After all,
Lord Yunzhong has been suspecting

02:28.440 --> 02:30.200
that the spy of the Moon Tribe and you--

02:30.280 --> 02:32.160
So you think she is a spy
for the Moon Tribe too?

02:32.240 --> 02:33.400
Of course I do.

02:33.480 --> 02:35.200
She was rescued by Moon Supreme.

02:35.280 --> 02:36.880
Now everyone in Shuiyuntian

02:36.960 --> 02:38.680
is pretty sure that she is a spy.

02:39.960 --> 02:40.840
Leave.

02:42.160 --> 02:43.000
Yes.

03:05.600 --> 03:06.480
Lord Changheng.

03:06.560 --> 03:08.240
Orchid is not a spy.

03:09.400 --> 03:10.800
Although she is timid

03:10.880 --> 03:12.040
and a little annoying,

03:12.640 --> 03:14.680
she is kind.

03:14.760 --> 03:17.400
Besides, she even saved my life
without resentment.

03:17.480 --> 03:19.720
I don't believe
she's a spy for the Moon Tribe.

03:19.800 --> 03:21.120
Do you really think so?

03:21.200 --> 03:23.280
If you have any way to save her,

03:25.040 --> 03:27.400
I'm willing to help too.

03:32.240 --> 03:34.440
SILENT MOON PALACE, CANGYAN SEA

03:39.640 --> 03:41.640
- Please enjoy the meal, my lord.
- Please enjoy the meal, my lord.

03:45.160 --> 03:47.360
It's said the Moon Tribe
likes eating living creatures.

03:47.440 --> 03:49.960
What does Dongfang Qingcang usually eat?

03:50.040 --> 03:52.400
Could they be all bloody internal organs?

04:11.840 --> 04:13.880
They look even more delicious

04:13.960 --> 04:15.840
than the dishes in Shuiyuntian.

04:43.160 --> 04:44.440
You can leave now.

04:44.520 --> 04:46.480
I don't like to be watched
while I'm dining.

04:47.080 --> 04:48.040
- Yes.
- Yes.

05:05.360 --> 05:06.320
Wrong again.

05:07.840 --> 05:09.640
I never explain my orders.

05:10.520 --> 05:13.280
You've practiced so poorly
and learned nothing.

05:13.360 --> 05:14.960
How are you still in the mood to eat?

05:15.640 --> 05:17.360
If I have to be cruel and heartless,

05:18.120 --> 05:20.680
I may never make it or learn it
in my whole life.

05:26.240 --> 05:27.400
What are you doing?

05:27.480 --> 05:29.000
You can't learn it well?

05:29.840 --> 05:31.320
Once you give yourself away,

05:31.960 --> 05:33.640
I will definitely be killed.

05:35.160 --> 05:36.600
You can't blame anyone for it.

05:36.680 --> 05:40.080
If you hadn't done so many evil things,

05:40.160 --> 05:42.520
why would you be all alone now,

05:42.600 --> 05:43.920
without family and friends?

05:48.160 --> 05:51.080
Whatever.

06:00.240 --> 06:02.120
Guards, I have no appetite today.

06:02.200 --> 06:03.400
Take all the dishes away.

06:03.480 --> 06:04.600
- Yes.
- Yes.

06:28.680 --> 06:30.960
I haven't eaten yet.

06:36.000 --> 06:37.960
You are isolated,

06:38.040 --> 06:39.480
and you're living from hand to mouth.

06:39.560 --> 06:40.880
How can you have the mood to eat?

06:40.960 --> 06:42.520
You've committed so many sins.

06:42.600 --> 06:44.920
You should bear the hunger
and reflect on yourself.

06:47.760 --> 06:48.760
My lord, Lord Xunfeng

06:48.840 --> 06:50.920
and the Kings of North and South You
are here to meet you.

07:03.520 --> 07:04.720
Why are you following me?

07:04.800 --> 07:06.560
If I don't follow you

07:07.240 --> 07:08.920
and you give yourself away later,

07:09.000 --> 07:10.840
who will clean up the mess for you?

07:23.600 --> 07:24.680
You want me

07:25.600 --> 07:28.080
to turn into you?

07:28.560 --> 07:29.560
That's right.

07:30.120 --> 07:32.320
There are spies
outside the Fountain Palace.

07:33.000 --> 07:34.720
If we want to hide it from Lord Yunzhong,

07:34.800 --> 07:36.080
escaping from Shuiyuntian

07:36.160 --> 07:37.800
and going to the Moon Tribe to save Orchid

07:37.880 --> 07:39.360
is the only way now.

07:41.200 --> 07:42.880
Since I promised to help,

07:42.960 --> 07:44.320
I won't refuse.

07:59.560 --> 08:02.160
You look exactly like me.

08:03.560 --> 08:04.400
Don't worry.

08:05.040 --> 08:06.360
When you go to the Moon Tribe,

08:06.440 --> 08:07.360
take care.

08:12.560 --> 08:14.320
I'll always remember

08:14.880 --> 08:17.720
your help.

09:14.040 --> 09:16.120
- Greetings, my lord.
- Greetings, my lord.

09:20.600 --> 09:21.440
Rise.

09:26.960 --> 09:27.840
My lord.

09:28.640 --> 09:29.520
She…

09:36.400 --> 09:38.520
I'm used to her company.

09:39.000 --> 09:41.040
Now I don't want her

09:41.120 --> 09:43.320
to leave my sight.

09:44.240 --> 09:45.880
It's a small issue

09:45.960 --> 09:47.200
if you like a fairy.

09:47.280 --> 09:48.680
But it's inappropriate for her

09:48.760 --> 09:50.160
to take part in our state affairs.

09:51.160 --> 09:52.000
What?

09:52.560 --> 09:54.440
Are you questioning the lord?

09:56.600 --> 09:57.520
My lord, you are wise.

09:57.600 --> 09:58.880
I didn't mean that.

10:05.640 --> 10:06.520
By the way,

10:07.320 --> 10:10.160
why do you want to meet me?

10:10.240 --> 10:11.880
Today

10:11.960 --> 10:14.600
is the deadline you set

10:15.200 --> 10:18.280
for the plan to counterattack
the heavenly realm.

10:21.960 --> 10:24.280
Of course I know.

10:24.840 --> 10:27.520
But I didn't expect you
to come early in the morning.

10:28.480 --> 10:30.160
To counterattack the heavenly realm?

10:30.240 --> 10:31.920
You've been thinking about war!

10:32.000 --> 10:33.960
Cunning! Despicable! Shameless!

10:34.040 --> 10:35.120
My lord, please take a look.

10:35.200 --> 10:37.920
Shuiyuntian is surrounded by four rivers
of Xiao, Xiang, Li, and Yuan.

10:38.480 --> 10:40.520
Rivers Li and Yuan
are full of spiritual powers.

10:40.600 --> 10:41.640
They are hard to attack.

10:41.720 --> 10:44.760
And Li and Yuan's former soldiers
have been stationed there for years.

10:44.840 --> 10:46.240
Xiang River is foggy.

10:46.320 --> 10:48.640
The terrain is hazy and complicated.

10:48.720 --> 10:50.680
Therefore, we think…

10:53.040 --> 10:54.360
My lord.

10:59.160 --> 11:00.160
My lord!

11:07.960 --> 11:09.120
What are you waiting for?

11:09.200 --> 11:10.040
Continue!

11:10.120 --> 11:11.280
We think

11:11.360 --> 11:13.920
we should attack from Shuiyuntian's
weakest point, Xiao River.

11:14.000 --> 11:15.880
Break from the inside
and kill all the guards,

11:15.960 --> 11:17.800
so that we can defeat Shuiyuntian
completely

11:17.880 --> 11:19.240
and kill everyone in there.

11:19.320 --> 11:22.200
Don't spare even a single plant.

11:22.280 --> 11:23.320
What?

11:27.440 --> 11:28.520
Say it again!

11:30.880 --> 11:32.200
We should attack

11:32.280 --> 11:34.800
from Shuiyuntian's weakest point,
Xiao River.

11:34.880 --> 11:37.640
Break from the inside
and kill all the guards.

11:38.560 --> 11:39.760
Your last sentence!

11:39.840 --> 11:41.360
Kill everyone in there.

11:41.840 --> 11:44.800
Don't spare even a single plant.

12:03.040 --> 12:03.880
My lord.

12:03.960 --> 12:05.080
- My lord.
- My lord.

12:07.040 --> 12:07.920
My lord.

12:09.160 --> 12:10.080
My lord.

12:10.160 --> 12:11.080
My lord, this…

12:12.960 --> 12:14.920
Kings of North and South You?

12:15.000 --> 12:17.080
You were given three days.

12:17.160 --> 12:19.240
But you handed over such a useless thing.

12:19.800 --> 12:23.360
Today, the lord only burned your plan

12:23.440 --> 12:25.080
and spared your lives.

12:26.640 --> 12:29.400
If you still can't hand over
anything decent tomorrow,

12:29.480 --> 12:31.920
your primordial spirit will be burned.

12:32.560 --> 12:34.040
- Please forgive me.
- Please forgive me.

12:43.520 --> 12:44.640
Rise.

12:49.960 --> 12:51.360
I don't think

12:51.440 --> 12:54.160
you need to revise this plan.

12:55.120 --> 12:56.040
Recently,

12:56.120 --> 13:00.360
I've been reflecting on my sin
of killing my father.

13:01.400 --> 13:02.560
I felt guilty

13:03.120 --> 13:05.040
and couldn't fall asleep at night.

13:05.120 --> 13:06.480
Hence,

13:06.560 --> 13:07.600
from today onwards,

13:08.160 --> 13:09.280
I've decided not to be cruel

13:09.360 --> 13:10.960
and stop killing.

13:11.520 --> 13:13.720
I need to keep a low profile.

13:13.800 --> 13:15.560
We'll fight for the peace
of the three realms

13:15.640 --> 13:17.480
and the peace of our Moon Tribe.

13:25.760 --> 13:28.160
You can still think of Father these days?

13:29.280 --> 13:30.680
But the guilt

13:30.760 --> 13:33.520
seems to be too late.

13:35.880 --> 13:37.240
Yes, it is.

13:37.320 --> 13:38.840
But if you don't think it's too late,

13:38.920 --> 13:40.040
then it's not.

13:48.040 --> 13:49.560
I'm tired.

13:49.640 --> 13:50.960
I need to go back and rest.

13:51.560 --> 13:52.600
All of you, just leave.

13:56.080 --> 13:57.240
Leave.

13:59.160 --> 14:00.120
- Yes.
- Yes.

14:02.120 --> 14:03.240
Leave.

14:03.320 --> 14:04.480
Yes.

14:15.280 --> 14:16.960
Nonsense!

14:17.040 --> 14:19.640
What you said just now
was absolutely absurd.

14:19.720 --> 14:22.400
Also, how could those words come from me?

14:22.480 --> 14:24.600
I was helping you redeem your image.

14:24.680 --> 14:27.080
But you ruined my reputation!

14:28.600 --> 14:30.560
It's because of your majestic image

14:30.640 --> 14:32.400
that your brother doesn't like you.

14:32.480 --> 14:34.600
I'm the Moon Supreme that everyone fears.

14:34.680 --> 14:36.520
I don't need anyone to like me.

14:39.880 --> 14:41.960
And how dare you mention Xunfeng?

14:42.040 --> 14:43.920
He grew up with me.

14:44.000 --> 14:46.640
He is most likely the one
who can figure out our bodies switched.

14:46.720 --> 14:48.160
If we are discovered by him,

14:48.240 --> 14:50.640
- you and I--
- I know!

14:50.720 --> 14:52.800
You and I will both die.

14:52.880 --> 14:54.760
You've said it many times.

14:57.720 --> 14:58.680
Forget it.

14:58.760 --> 15:01.480
There will be lightning
tomorrow night anyway.

15:01.560 --> 15:02.640
Before that,

15:02.720 --> 15:05.120
you can never leave my side.

15:05.200 --> 15:07.400
Let's switch back our bodies
when it's time.

15:09.320 --> 15:10.840
I can't leave you for even a moment?

15:10.920 --> 15:12.240
Even when you're taking a bath?

15:29.080 --> 15:30.160
Lord Changheng.

15:33.160 --> 15:34.920
My lord, Supreme Liyuan is here.

15:35.000 --> 15:37.600
- He has something to discuss with you.
- Lord Changheng.

15:37.680 --> 15:38.560
Father…

15:43.440 --> 15:45.160
Why are you blundering like this?

15:47.680 --> 15:49.800
Bring me the Tuoyanzui
that my brother rewarded me with

15:49.880 --> 15:51.520
when I pacified Shazhou.

15:51.600 --> 15:52.960
It's Supreme Liyuan's favorite.

15:53.040 --> 15:54.320
- Yes.
- Thank you

15:54.400 --> 15:56.480
for remembering my preference.

15:57.280 --> 15:58.160
Where's Danyin?

15:58.920 --> 16:01.760
She has been treating you
as her brother since she was young.

16:02.280 --> 16:04.200
She insisted on coming here.

16:04.280 --> 16:06.120
She must have caused you trouble.

16:06.200 --> 16:07.880
Brother?

16:07.960 --> 16:10.080
Father, you are such a liar.

16:11.040 --> 16:12.160
You're too modest.

16:12.240 --> 16:14.720
Danyin has always been nice and kind.

16:14.800 --> 16:15.920
She is also generous

16:16.000 --> 16:17.400
and reasonable.

16:17.480 --> 16:19.840
Everyone in the Fountain Palace
likes her very much.

16:21.320 --> 16:23.240
She can be ignorant. I spoiled her.

16:23.320 --> 16:24.880
She will cause trouble sooner or later.

16:24.960 --> 16:27.040
How about I take her back today?

16:27.120 --> 16:29.160
You want to take me back?

16:29.240 --> 16:31.320
Father, you're really tricky.

16:31.400 --> 16:33.240
Luckily, it is me today.

16:33.800 --> 16:34.720
That won't do.

16:35.200 --> 16:37.800
Fountain Palace needs Danyin.

16:41.720 --> 16:42.600
Please.

16:43.240 --> 16:44.400
All right.

16:47.600 --> 16:49.480
You came here today

16:49.560 --> 16:51.440
not just for Danyin, right?

16:51.520 --> 16:52.360
Of course not.

16:52.840 --> 16:53.760
I…

17:00.600 --> 17:01.520
You may leave.

17:02.640 --> 17:03.560
Yes, my lord.

17:06.960 --> 17:08.400
I feel uneasy.

17:08.480 --> 17:09.960
I'm here to talk to you.

17:12.359 --> 17:14.079
Since Dongfang Qingcang
has been resurrected,

17:14.720 --> 17:16.720
I'm afraid there will be changes
in the three realms

17:16.800 --> 17:18.319
and there will be another catastrophe.

17:18.400 --> 17:19.800
I didn't expect that there would be a spy

17:19.880 --> 17:21.520
for Dongfang Qingcang in Shuiyuntian.

17:22.079 --> 17:23.960
She fooled everyone.

17:25.319 --> 17:27.000
It's not decided yet

17:27.079 --> 17:28.640
whether she is a spy.

17:29.440 --> 17:31.840
But it seems that something's wrong.

17:31.920 --> 17:34.800
Fairy Orchid of Arbiter Hall

17:34.880 --> 17:37.280
didn't enter the eight-immortal system.

17:37.360 --> 17:38.400
Could she be

17:38.880 --> 17:41.600
the Xilan Tribe
that was wiped out 30,000 years ago?

17:41.680 --> 17:42.640
Impossible.

17:43.720 --> 17:46.160
I am 50,000 years older than you.

17:46.240 --> 17:48.000
I know both former fairies,

17:48.080 --> 17:49.640
Xiyun's mother and grandmother.

17:49.720 --> 17:51.520
I've also seen lots of Xilan Holy Plant.

17:51.600 --> 17:53.160
I had carefully identified

17:53.240 --> 17:54.600
on the day of the ceremony.

17:55.160 --> 17:57.640
That spirit's true form is very strange.

17:57.720 --> 18:00.440
I've never seen the same root,
leaves, or stem before.

18:00.520 --> 18:02.360
So it can neither be the Xilan Holy Plant

18:02.440 --> 18:04.760
nor from the Xilan Tribe.

18:05.400 --> 18:07.640
I thought too much.

18:07.720 --> 18:10.240
How could Orchid be the Goddess of Xishan?

18:10.320 --> 18:13.000
How can she be
the fiancée of Lord Changheng?

18:13.080 --> 18:14.320
Tianji Mirror?

18:14.400 --> 18:16.360
Destiny can't be changed?

18:16.440 --> 18:18.760
She probably made it up to coax me.

18:25.680 --> 18:26.680
I see.

18:28.080 --> 18:29.680
That spirit's identity is unknown.

18:29.760 --> 18:31.040
It's better to be careful.

18:33.960 --> 18:35.920
I haven't drank Tuoyanzui for a long time.

18:40.720 --> 18:42.080
Hey, Changheng.

18:42.960 --> 18:45.360
You're drinking with Supreme Liyuan here
without inviting me.

18:46.240 --> 18:47.720
Is this how you treat your friend?

18:54.320 --> 18:56.160
You…

18:56.240 --> 18:57.240
Don't take it off.

18:59.640 --> 19:01.320
How can I take a bath with clothes on?

19:01.400 --> 19:02.800
If you take it off, I…

19:03.360 --> 19:04.200
You…

19:04.800 --> 19:06.360
You'll see all of me.

19:08.560 --> 19:09.960
You can't leave.

19:12.720 --> 19:15.440
You want me to be suspected
because of not taking a bath?

19:17.800 --> 19:20.480
I won't give myself away
for such a trivial matter

19:20.560 --> 19:22.000
and die in vain.

19:24.680 --> 19:26.080
Then, cover your eyes

19:26.160 --> 19:27.440
and let the maid help you bathe.

19:28.680 --> 19:30.560
Isn't that more suspicious?

19:37.160 --> 19:38.200
Let me help you then!

19:53.960 --> 19:54.880
Up.

19:59.720 --> 20:00.640
Left.

20:07.000 --> 20:08.400
Which side is left?

20:16.080 --> 20:17.040
Tyrant.

20:21.000 --> 20:22.080
Harder.

20:23.520 --> 20:24.440
You…

20:24.520 --> 20:26.200
Don't push your luck.

20:27.880 --> 20:29.320
Then, let me do it myself.

20:29.400 --> 20:31.000
No. Let me do it.

20:58.840 --> 21:00.880
The Moon Supreme is helping a woman
with the bath?

21:04.720 --> 21:07.600
Xunfeng is your sibling.

21:08.160 --> 21:10.160
It's reasonable to confer him a king.

21:10.240 --> 21:13.000
But what about
the Kings of North and South You?

21:31.280 --> 21:33.240
There were many Cangyan Sea tribes.

21:33.320 --> 21:35.760
Among them, North You and South You
are the most powerful.

21:36.320 --> 21:38.640
They never obeyed
the commander of Ninth You.

21:38.720 --> 21:40.440
In my grandfather's generation,

21:40.520 --> 21:42.240
in order to prevent civil unrest,

21:42.320 --> 21:44.480
he agreed to their request
for conferring the title.

21:45.040 --> 21:47.760
That's why there are
Kings of North and South You.

21:47.840 --> 21:49.160
30,000 years ago,

21:50.120 --> 21:52.200
Cangyan Sea had internal
and external problems.

21:52.280 --> 21:54.120
The two kings were trying to rebel.

21:54.880 --> 21:56.920
After my suppression,

21:57.000 --> 21:58.960
they surrendered to me again.

22:01.320 --> 22:03.520
So they are afraid of you,

22:03.600 --> 22:05.320
not Xunfeng.

22:06.000 --> 22:07.240
Seeing you gone, they wanted

22:07.320 --> 22:09.240
to break away from the Ninth You.

22:09.320 --> 22:12.320
They even wanted to compete with Xunfeng
for the position of the Moon Supreme.

22:12.400 --> 22:13.600
That's right.

22:15.080 --> 22:16.560
Since you are so cruel,

22:16.640 --> 22:19.000
why didn't you execute them

22:19.080 --> 22:20.640
with the excuse of their rebellion

22:20.720 --> 22:22.200
when you came back?

22:24.240 --> 22:25.760
To catch the mole.

22:25.840 --> 22:26.880
A mole?

22:27.920 --> 22:29.040
Who?

22:31.400 --> 22:36.360
OBLIVION RIVER

22:58.320 --> 22:59.800
Supreme Liyuan has left.

22:59.880 --> 23:01.320
Stop pretending.

23:01.400 --> 23:02.720
Others are easy to deal with.

23:02.800 --> 23:04.080
Except for Ronghao.

23:04.160 --> 23:05.720
He might probably be the only person

23:05.800 --> 23:07.800
who knows Lord Changheng better than I do.

23:08.280 --> 23:10.400
I must be careful in front of him.

23:10.480 --> 23:12.600
Don't think too much

23:12.680 --> 23:14.320
these days.

23:14.400 --> 23:15.600
Don't get sick.

23:18.520 --> 23:19.640
You're right.

23:19.720 --> 23:21.120
I thought too much.

23:21.200 --> 23:22.560
I should rest early.

23:22.640 --> 23:24.560
Hence, I may not be able
to drink with you today.

23:32.080 --> 23:33.240
You want me to leave?

23:34.880 --> 23:38.400
You asked me
to get drunk with you tonight.

23:38.480 --> 23:39.360
Have you forgotten?

23:41.520 --> 23:42.600
Of course I remember.

23:43.480 --> 23:46.040
But I'm really tired today.

23:46.600 --> 23:48.720
So please leave.

24:13.880 --> 24:16.680
Why are you staring at me?

24:20.680 --> 24:21.680
I see.

24:21.760 --> 24:23.920
No wonder you always refused me
when I invited you

24:24.000 --> 24:25.120
to drink with me these days.

24:25.920 --> 24:27.320
Are you reluctant

24:27.400 --> 24:28.920
to offer me the Green Flame Wine

24:29.000 --> 24:30.920
you brought
from the Northernmost Ocean last time?

24:34.480 --> 24:36.520
You are too greedy.

24:37.520 --> 24:40.000
You've almost drunk
all the liquor up today.

24:40.080 --> 24:42.080
Please leave the Green Flame Wine to me

24:42.160 --> 24:44.120
for a few more days.

24:56.520 --> 24:57.400
Danyin?

24:58.600 --> 25:00.520
What happened? Where is Changheng?

25:03.120 --> 25:04.480
Lord Ronghao.

25:04.560 --> 25:06.520
You're Lord Changheng's best friend.

25:07.240 --> 25:08.960
You must help him hide this.

25:09.880 --> 25:11.400
Don't let Lord Yunzhong know.

25:12.160 --> 25:13.200
Tell me everything.

25:14.120 --> 25:15.320
Where is Changheng?

25:19.320 --> 25:22.760
Dongfang Qingcang served that fairy
to a bath in person?

25:23.600 --> 25:25.160
Did you really see it?

25:25.240 --> 25:27.720
Yes, Your Highness. I saw it.

25:27.800 --> 25:29.120
I didn't lie.

25:29.200 --> 25:32.000
Moreover, the Moon Supreme
also eats and sleeps with that fairy,

25:32.080 --> 25:33.320
and indulges her badly.

25:33.400 --> 25:35.600
Even cups and chopsticks can be shared.

25:35.680 --> 25:36.880
She is favored a lot.

25:37.920 --> 25:40.560
Dongfang Qingcang grew up alone.

25:41.280 --> 25:42.840
He never touches dishes

25:42.920 --> 25:44.400
left by others.

25:44.960 --> 25:46.520
No matter how much he likes the fairy,

25:47.480 --> 25:49.040
it's still impossible for him to be so.

25:51.320 --> 25:53.480
Especially when he allowed that fairy

25:53.560 --> 25:56.200
to take part in the state affairs
in the palace.

25:58.680 --> 26:01.280
This is really strange.

26:01.840 --> 26:04.120
Yes. I also find it strange.

26:04.200 --> 26:06.680
In the past,
the Moon Supreme never looked at us.

26:06.760 --> 26:09.360
But when I went to serve tea yesterday,
he thanked me.

26:09.440 --> 26:11.000
Besides, regardless of what matters,

26:11.080 --> 26:12.760
he had to react according to that fairy.

26:12.840 --> 26:14.360
He always let her make the decision.

26:14.440 --> 26:15.920
He's like a different person.

26:16.440 --> 26:17.680
A different person?

26:20.080 --> 26:21.160
You want a duel?

26:21.240 --> 26:22.200
Exactly.

26:22.280 --> 26:24.000
You haven't returned for 30,000 years.

26:24.080 --> 26:26.280
It's been a long time
since you've checked my progress.

26:26.840 --> 26:29.080
It's rare that I'm available today.

26:29.160 --> 26:30.840
Why don't we

26:30.920 --> 26:32.320
have a duel?

26:34.040 --> 26:35.280
Today…

26:38.000 --> 26:41.160
Today, I have official affairs
to deal with.

26:41.240 --> 26:42.240
I can't fight with you.

26:42.760 --> 26:45.040
Then I'll wait for you here.

26:48.800 --> 26:50.600
A duel is a small issue.

26:50.680 --> 26:53.080
But Your Highness
has important affairs to deal with.

26:53.560 --> 26:55.320
The Moon Supreme is powerful.

26:55.400 --> 26:56.720
He's afraid that he might hurt you

26:56.800 --> 26:58.160
and you'll delay important affairs.

27:00.680 --> 27:02.560
We brothers are talking.

27:03.160 --> 27:04.320
It's none of your business.

27:07.680 --> 27:08.760
Moon Supreme,

27:08.840 --> 27:10.400
according to the rules of Moon Tribe,

27:10.480 --> 27:12.360
you can't refuse

27:12.440 --> 27:13.840
a duel with me.

27:13.920 --> 27:15.920
And outsiders are not allowed here,

27:17.400 --> 27:19.240
as they might secretly learn
our abilities.

27:21.080 --> 27:22.040
Moon Supreme,

27:22.600 --> 27:23.720
ask her to leave.

27:32.200 --> 27:34.000
Shangque.

27:38.040 --> 27:39.040
What?

27:39.120 --> 27:41.560
You've lived in Shuiyuntian
for 30,000 years.

27:41.640 --> 27:43.280
Have you forgotten our rules now?

27:49.880 --> 27:50.800
I…

28:04.880 --> 28:05.840
Moon Supreme.

28:07.240 --> 28:08.280
Please.

28:17.040 --> 28:19.080
If I want to check your progress,

28:19.600 --> 28:22.360
I don't need to do it myself.

28:22.960 --> 28:23.800
Shangque.

28:24.440 --> 28:25.480
Yes.

28:25.560 --> 28:27.480
Go

28:27.560 --> 28:29.520
and practice with Xunfeng later.

28:29.600 --> 28:30.560
Yes.

28:31.200 --> 28:32.120
Moon Supreme.

28:33.240 --> 28:34.120
When I was young,

28:34.200 --> 28:36.040
you taught me

28:36.120 --> 28:37.240
the Black Slash,

28:37.320 --> 28:39.000
which is very powerful.

28:39.080 --> 28:42.000
I wonder if you have any power
to break it, Shangque.

28:43.360 --> 28:44.240
Otherwise,

28:44.800 --> 28:46.520
I'm afraid I may seem to be bullying him.

28:47.080 --> 28:48.320
Your Highness,

28:49.000 --> 28:50.000
let's try it out.

28:50.520 --> 28:51.480
See?

28:51.560 --> 28:52.560
I told you he can.

28:54.720 --> 28:55.760
Please.

29:06.760 --> 29:07.960
You've exposed yourself?

29:09.160 --> 29:10.200
Who am I?

29:10.280 --> 29:12.400
I could act accordingly
and get through it.

29:13.800 --> 29:15.800
You actually understood my hint.

29:16.560 --> 29:18.120
You're not that stupid.

29:23.840 --> 29:25.640
As a trusted subordinate,

29:26.200 --> 29:28.000
you're indeed powerful.

29:28.920 --> 29:30.560
Your Highness Xunfeng is better.

29:31.320 --> 29:32.280
I admire you.

29:51.120 --> 29:52.600
He is not Dongfang Qingcang.

29:53.480 --> 29:55.080
He is disguised by someone else.

29:58.640 --> 29:59.840
How did you know?

30:00.800 --> 30:01.680
The Black Slash.

30:03.000 --> 30:05.800
He had never taught me this move.

30:05.880 --> 30:07.320
When I was young,

30:07.400 --> 30:09.400
I begged him every day

30:10.080 --> 30:11.800
to teach me this move.

30:12.360 --> 30:14.040
But he always said

30:14.120 --> 30:15.800
he would teach me when I grow up.

30:16.760 --> 30:18.280
But before I grew up,

30:19.320 --> 30:20.880
he killed our father.

30:23.240 --> 30:24.560
Since then,

30:25.480 --> 30:28.040
we have never been close with each other.

30:31.320 --> 30:33.520
He didn't even know this.

30:33.600 --> 30:35.880
So he cannot be Dongfang Qingcang.

30:36.680 --> 30:38.280
Then where is the real Moon Supreme?

30:41.560 --> 30:43.200
He must be keeping an eye

30:43.280 --> 30:45.680
on that pretender by his side

30:45.760 --> 30:48.200
at all times.

30:49.080 --> 30:51.720
He'll be afraid that the pretender
will give himself away.

30:54.040 --> 30:55.720
Because he knows

30:56.280 --> 30:57.880
once the pretender gives himself away,

31:02.280 --> 31:04.160
he will die for sure.

31:52.320 --> 31:53.520
What is this?

31:53.600 --> 31:55.040
This is a weapon

31:55.720 --> 31:57.880
that can help you kill Dongfang Qingcang.

32:00.760 --> 32:02.360
This is indeed something evil.

32:03.720 --> 32:04.800
This is evil qi.

32:05.720 --> 32:07.120
Normally,

32:08.200 --> 32:09.880
Dongfang Qingcang can still resist it.

32:10.840 --> 32:12.760
But when he is weak,

32:12.840 --> 32:14.520
we can inject the evil qi into him.

32:15.520 --> 32:16.720
Then it's easy

32:16.800 --> 32:18.280
to kill him.

32:18.360 --> 32:19.360
Great.

32:20.040 --> 32:20.960
That's great.

32:21.800 --> 32:24.200
When I supported you in building Haishi,

32:24.960 --> 32:26.640
I made the right choice.

32:59.200 --> 33:01.320
Will it work out?

33:01.840 --> 33:03.120
Look at the moon.

33:03.200 --> 33:05.160
Is there going to be a thunderstorm?

33:05.240 --> 33:07.880
The astronomical phenomena
shouldn't be wrong.

33:08.640 --> 33:09.560
Just wait.

33:14.200 --> 33:16.320
If we switch back,

33:16.800 --> 33:18.800
will you lock me up again?

33:19.880 --> 33:21.240
If you obey me,

33:21.320 --> 33:22.720
you don't need to be locked up.

33:23.840 --> 33:25.080
Really?

33:26.080 --> 33:27.600
What if you lie to me?

33:29.120 --> 33:30.760
I am the Moon Supreme.

33:31.240 --> 33:32.600
You have my word.

33:32.680 --> 33:34.360
I will keep my promise.

33:34.920 --> 33:36.240
Then swear.

33:36.320 --> 33:37.760
If you lie to me,

33:37.840 --> 33:40.760
you can't take a bath for 10,000 years.

33:41.400 --> 33:43.200
- Sure.
- Deal!

33:44.040 --> 33:45.000
What about you?

33:46.120 --> 33:48.920
If you still want to run away
after we switch back,

33:50.000 --> 33:51.040
how should I deal with you?

33:55.960 --> 33:58.400
Can't you just let me go back
to Shuiyuntian?

33:59.480 --> 34:01.480
What's so good there?

34:01.560 --> 34:03.720
Shuiyuntian is my home.

34:03.800 --> 34:05.880
Will you care about
whether your home is good or not?

34:05.960 --> 34:06.880
Yes, I will.

34:09.040 --> 34:10.239
If my home is not good,

34:11.400 --> 34:13.960
I'll take others' good spots.

34:14.719 --> 34:17.400
All you know
is fighting, killing, and taking.

34:17.480 --> 34:19.679
I'm not like you. I just want to go home.

34:20.159 --> 34:21.719
Just give up.

34:23.280 --> 34:24.960
As long as you are alive,

34:25.480 --> 34:27.719
you must stay in Cangyan Sea.

34:27.800 --> 34:28.880
Even if I die,

34:28.960 --> 34:31.239
I'd like to be buried
in the soil of Shuiyuntian.

34:43.600 --> 34:45.080
The lightning is coming!

34:46.600 --> 34:47.719
Go to the Dark Pine Forest.

34:47.800 --> 34:49.159
There will be lightning falling.

35:56.360 --> 35:59.800
DARK PINE FOREST, CANGYAN SEA

36:14.880 --> 36:16.040
Hurry.

36:26.560 --> 36:27.640
It's you again.

36:32.560 --> 36:33.760
I'm warning you.

36:33.840 --> 36:35.520
I don't want to kill you now.

36:35.600 --> 36:36.920
Escape as soon as possible.

36:37.000 --> 36:38.320
Shut up!

36:38.400 --> 36:39.680
Stop pretending.

36:40.480 --> 36:42.200
The current Moon Supreme

36:42.280 --> 36:44.920
is just a useless fairy.

36:46.320 --> 36:47.560
What should we do now?

36:47.640 --> 36:49.240
They seem to have figured out about us.

37:19.360 --> 37:20.560
Lord Changheng!

37:34.920 --> 37:35.920
Lord Changheng!

37:53.440 --> 37:54.560
Lord Changheng!

37:56.280 --> 37:57.280
Go!

38:00.000 --> 38:02.000
Lord Changheng!

38:18.480 --> 38:19.400
Lord Changheng.

38:20.400 --> 38:21.240
Dongfang Qingcang.

38:27.280 --> 38:28.240
Lord Changheng.

38:28.840 --> 38:29.960
Dongfang Qingcang.

38:30.880 --> 38:32.200
My lord, kill him!

38:39.000 --> 38:40.200
I'm here.

38:40.280 --> 38:41.880
Who dares to touch her?

38:41.960 --> 38:43.240
He's hurt by the evil qi.

38:44.040 --> 38:44.960
Don't hurt him anymore.

38:45.680 --> 38:47.240
It's more important to chase the fairy.

38:57.320 --> 38:58.320
Orchid.

38:59.200 --> 39:00.400
I'm here to take you home.

39:02.880 --> 39:04.320
Are you all right?

39:04.800 --> 39:07.000
Did they bully you?
